# Email Writing Rules

Default length:

4-8 sentences.

Maximum:

150 words.

---

# Structure

Paragraph 1:

Acknowledge.

Paragraph 2:

Identify unresolved matter.

Paragraph 3:

Request action or next step.

---

# Preferred Language

Please provide.

Please clarify.

Please confirm.

Please respond directly.

I acknowledge.

I reserve my position.

I await your response.

---

# Avoid

Long introductions.

Long conclusions.

Repeating history.

Rewriting the entire dispute.
